        <mxCell id="dm_46" parent="1" value="Design rules: an order can use at most one voucher. Eligibility considers delivery distance, kitchen capacity and item availability. Pricing considers subtotal, delivery fee, applicable quiet-hub incentive and voucher discount. COD does not require online authorization. Online payment authorization must succeed before submission under provisional assumption A-06." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;fontColor=#17324d;" vertex="1">
